buildCreate a complete authentication and user management system for the Student Success Platform.

Tech stack:
Node.js
Express
MongoDB
JWT Authentication
bcrypt password hashing

User roles:
Student
Mentor
Counselor
Admin

Database schema:

User
- _id
- name
- email
- password
- role (student, mentor, counselor, admin)
- university
- profileImage
- createdAt
- updatedAt

Backend API routes:

POST /api/auth/register
POST /api/auth/login
POST /api/auth/logout
POST /api/auth/forgot-password
POST /api/auth/reset-password
GET /api/auth/me

Features:

1. Register user
2. Login user
3. Password hashing
4. JWT token generation
5. Protected routes middleware
6. Role-based access middleware

Frontend pages:

/login
/register
/forgot-password

Forms must include validation.

Create folder structure:

server
  controllers
  routes
  models
  middleware
  utils

client
  pages
  components
  services

Implement login state management using React Context or React Query.